f1b68d279e8eba0642376becd33547","session_date":"2023-06-09","session_datetime":"2023-06-09T14:31:00","session_id":"session_8","session_index":8,"source_sha256":"756a5d32bb7945dcef724a947c689d61bacf9ce1ba76a1a8c721a882abc0c482","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":10}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: Hey Dave! Met with the creative team for my album yesterday. It was a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together. \n[S8T1] (dia_id: D8:1)\n\nDave: Hey Cal! Sounds great that your album's coming along. Are you feeling good about it? Here's a pic I just took.\n[Image caption: a photography of a pond with a boat in it surrounded by trees]\n[S8T2] (dia_id: D8:2)\n\nCalvin: Dave, thanks for checking in. I'm feeling stoked about this album! We've been making some magic with a team in the studio, working on the music and everything. Look at what a wonderful studio we have! How have you been? Anything new since we talked?\n[Image caption: a photo of a recording studio with a large window and a desk]\n[S8T3] (dia_id: D8:3)\n\nDave: Hey, nice photo of the studio! Working in a team yields incredible results, well done! Keep pushing it! I've been doing good - thanks for asking. I've been exploring some parks on the weekends to relax - it's so peaceful being surrounded by nature. Are there any chill spots you enjoy in Boston?\n[S8T4] (dia_id: D8:4)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! That studio is great for creativity. I've never been to Boston before, but I hear the parks are amazing. Can't wait to visit next month. Anything cool you remember about Boston parks?\n[Image caption: a photo of a tree with pink flowers in the foreground]\n[S8T5] (dia_id: D8:5)\n\nDave: That sounds great! The Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring. It's so serene when you're walking around. I went for a stroll last Friday and it was amazing. It's so magical - I bet you'll love it! I love taking walks on the weekends, they recharge me for the entire upcoming week!\n[S8T6] (dia_id: D8:6)\n\nCalvin: I'm excited to experience that serenity. I can't wait to take a walk in the parks and recharge. Hey, have you been on any hikes lately?\n[Image caption: a photo of a path going up a hill with a view of the mountains]\n[S8T7] (dia_id: D8:7)\n\nDave: Nah, haven't gone hiking recently, but it's awesome - being in nature and pushing yourself to new heights. Clears your mind and brings a sense of calm. Have you been to the mountains before? Heard they're super chill.\n[S8T8] (dia_id: D8:8)\n\nCalvin: Nah, haven't been to the mountains but I'm keen to go. Looking for a way to escape it all and de-stress. I want to go on a hike to a place similar to this. What's new and exciting happening for you, Dave?\n[Image caption: a photo of a plane flying over a mountain range with snow on the top]\n[S8T9] (dia_id: D8:9)\n\nDave: I booked a trip to a mountainous region for next month! Finally gonna be able to see those majestic peaks! Gonna be an amazing experience!\n[S8T10] (dia_id: D8:10)","text_sha256":"8f5f4595af36c7b2862b83dae05b57b0dd9a4ddab06d5ce3bf775583172f45b3","timestamp":"2023-06-09T14:31:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D18:7"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":31,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S18T7]"],"text_sha256":"8a0b0e2553dc1a8fb0400c29f366802d6a107c16ed37dc693121b5468876ec1b"},{"dia_ids":["D18:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":34,"line_start":33,"source_locators":["[S18T8]"],"text_sha256":"866794f0b12d5f1c72c2916ad3d60739995ec3d595e608602ae2d5eda57aa1fc"},{"dia_ids":["D18:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":37,"line_start":36,"source_locators":["[S18T9]"],"text_sha256":"ace74a40d1c6c511b8102ff618a11fb9f2c5af4962120105a3357cce71c63600"},{"dia_ids":["D18:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":40,"line_start":39,"source_locators":["[S18T10]"],"text_sha256":"cba0e3d21412bd508ca